1
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:10,080
Roujing, you're awake.

2
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:11,720
Zhangxin,

3
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,200
is it just you?

4
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,400
You're not still thinking
about He Shi, are you?

5
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,800
After how he treated you.

6
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:21,840
He was the first one
to see you attempt suicide.

7
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:22,920
D-Do you

8
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,840
know what he did?

9
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,970
Why did you call me here?

10
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:53,140
Can someone come over and deal with this?

11
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,400
I thought my leaving...

12
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,880
At least it'll add to his guilt.

13
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:00,720
Never punish yourself

14
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:01,920
for someone else's mistakes.

15
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:02,800
If you die,

16
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,360
he and Zhang Xin

17
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:05,360
will only cheat even more brazenly.

18
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,620
I definitely won't suffer in silence

19
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:14,200
this time.

20
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,400
Why are you wearing Roujing's clothes?

21
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,320
How is it?

22
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,320
Thrilling?

23
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,440
In this house,

24
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:32,290
He Shi only lets his guard down
around you.

25
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:35,640
You must get evidence
of his affair with Zhang Xin.

26
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:37,520
That's the only way
we can take them down for good.

27
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,840
Say my name.

28
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,320
Roujing.

29
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:42,960
Louder.

30
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,920
Shu Roujing.

31
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,040
Say it again.

32
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,240
Shu Roujing.

33
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:50,200
That's great, Roujing.

34
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,600
You've been a huge help again.

35
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:53,400
I should be the one thanking you.

36
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,920
If it weren't for you,

37
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:57,370
I might have stayed obsessed forever.

38
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,640
But what are you going to do next?

39
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,720
Send it directly to me.

40
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:02,880
I'll show it to my dad.

41
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:05,040
He can tolerate Zhang Xin
bullying you and me,

42
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:07,160
but he will never accept betrayal.

43
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:08,240
And...

44
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:09,760
I'm going to send this video

45
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:11,720
to media outlets to expose them.

46
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,760
I'll completely ruin Zhang Xin

47
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,280
and He Shi's reputations.

48
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,160
Okay.

49
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:19,079
I'll wait to see them
get what they deserve.

50
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,200
Zhangxin,

51
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,360
guess where I am.

52
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:31,560
Look who this is.

53
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,050
Second Brother!

54
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,360
Zhangxin,

55
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:38,250
don't come here.

56
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:41,570
Second Brother!

57
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:43,159
Who told you to come?

58
00:04:43,159 --> 00:04:43,880
Leave!

59
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:46,440
Are you all crazy?

60
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,500
Aren't you afraid I'll call the cops?

61
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,560
So noisy.

62
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,160
Fun.

63
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:09,820
Hand over the video you secretly filmed,

64
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,200
and we'll let him go.

65
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:12,400
How do you know?

66
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,680
Li Zhangxin,

67
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,840
do you think my position
as the mistress of the He family

68
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,280
is just for show?

69
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,240
I know exactly what you've been doing

70
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,720
in the manor.

71
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:22,920
I just found it thrilling

72
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:24,760
and didn't want to expose you.

73
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,240
What if I don't?

74
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:30,360
He Shi

75
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,240
is your own brother.

76
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,760
Are you really going
to treat him like this?

77
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:33,560
Brother?

78
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:38,159
Since that day,

79
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,840
I haven't had a brother.

80
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:43,000
You must be Shi and Yu.

81
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:45,320
Losing your parents so early...

82
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,680
you poor children.

83
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:50,040
I'm the director of this orphanage.

84
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,940
Here's a welcome gift for you.

85
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:56,960
Eat up.

86
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:00,760
Come here.

87
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:03,970
Good children get rewards.

88
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:07,400
Yu.

89
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,880
Director, I'm here.

90
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:10,800
Come here.

91
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:16,360
Director, can I have another candy?

92
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,020
I want to give it to my brother.

93
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,600
Do you want more candy?

94
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:23,240
Then come to my office tonight.

95
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:25,010
Okay. Thank you, Director.

96
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:29,640
Good boy, Yu.

97
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:42,320
Here,

98
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,680
drink some milk.

99
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,720
I can't drink it.

100
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,000
The director told me

101
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,840
I still need to go see him.

102
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:49,320
The director told me

103
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:51,640
you can go see him another day.

104
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:52,760
All right.

105
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:31,120
Why didn't you ever tell me this?

106
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:33,159
What's the point of telling you?

107
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,240
To pity me?

108
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:36,240
I never wanted

109
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:41,000
us to be enemies.

110
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,560
From the orphanage

111
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:44,640
to being adopted by the He family,

112
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,520
we've always had each other.

113
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,280
I thought

114
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:51,159
we could always stay together as brothers.

115
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:52,120
You know

116
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:54,280
we are blood brothers,

117
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,680
yet you always take her side.

118
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,920
I always thought

119
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:04,180
you were my biological brothers.

120
00:08:05,080 --> 00:08:06,800
Mom and Dad were married for years

121
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,040
without kids,

122
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:13,120
so they wanted to adopt one
to build good karma.

123
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,120
You were born shortly after

124
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,320
my brother and I

125
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:16,520
joined the He family.

126
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:18,160
So you had no idea

127
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,480
about any of this.

128
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,760
If it weren't for what you did...

129
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:27,680
How could I possibly stand against you?

130
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,570
You caused my car accident too,

131
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,760
didn't you?

132
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,500
When Zhangxin told me about your affair,

133
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,200
I finally remembered the accident.

134
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,080
He Shi,

135
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,920
I never thought

136
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:06,600
you could be so cruel to me.

137
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:09,210
You shouldn't have kept getting in my way.

138
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,600
Enough!

139
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,600
I really don't want to listen

140
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,660
to you two brothers arguing anymore.

141
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,240
Li Zhangxin,

142
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,320
make your choice.

143
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:34,400
Will you ruin me and He Shi,

144
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:36,160
or save He Yu?

145
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,200
He Yu!

146
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:43,560
Don't worry about me!

147
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:44,600
Run!

148
00:09:48,880 --> 00:09:49,800
Make your choice!
